DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261109
DTSTAMP:20261107T164402Z
UID:f0975a1b427097c90589d5f9c323@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate the 36th Annual Walktober in The Last Green Val
 ley National Heritage Corridor from Sept. 19 to Nov. 8. Featuring more tha
 n 250 unique hikes\, bikes\, paddles\, events and more\, Walktober is full
  of adventures for all ages! Walktober is a celebration of one of the nati
 on's oldest National Heritage Corridors\, right here in Connecticut\, in o
 ur most colorful season. We have an online guide to help you choose your a
 dventures and a printed guide too. Just give us a call or an email and we 
 can help you get one of the printed guides.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com
 /events/walktober-2026
LOCATION:The Last Green Valley National Heritage Corridor\, 203B Main St.
 \, Danielson CT\, 06239
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/walktober-2026
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:We Live Here
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260925
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261219
DTSTAMP:20261107T164402Z
UID:561fc4d7ef1ba7afe9fe435470b7@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:An exhibition that looks at housing as the framework of commun
 ity life. With historical images\, photography\, architectural designs\, r
 esident testimony\, and interactive displays\, We Live Here will place a c
 entury of residential life in the greater New London area and Connecticut 
 in the broader context of the nation. The history of dwelling is our socia
 l history. It illuminates how our communities live now and could live bett
 er in the future.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/we-live-here
LOCATION:The Garde Gallery\, Garde Arts Center\, 305 State Street\, New Lo
 ndon CT\, 06320
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/we-live-here
END:VEVENT
