BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pinocchio
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261122
DTSTAMP:20261107T164402Z
UID:df32ecff76406cf7cf989603fd9d@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:This fresh\, fast-paced\, story-within-a-story retelling of th
 e classic Pinocchio is brought to life by five actors weaving together liv
 e instruments\, shadow puppetry\, and boundless imagination. From the mome
 nt Geppetto carves him from a piece of wood\, Pinocchio dreams of becoming
  a real boy. But will the all-too-tempting delights of puppet shows and Pl
 ayland lead him astray? When Geppetto is swallowed by a whale\, it's up to
  this little puppet to summon his courage and prove that his love for Papa
  is real—and discover what it truly means to be alive.\n\nSource: https:
 //ctvisit.com/events/pinocchio
LOCATION:Playhouse on Park\, 244 Park Road\, West Hartford CT\, 06119
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/pinocchio
